/-!
# The band data and the band checks (lane A10): computational core

Campaign `ProofRuns/2026-09-28_analytic_large_n`, lane A10.  Lean core only (precompiled, library
`Erdos993LeanTailCertCompute`).  The data are copies of `Profile30.edges`, `Profile30.tvals`,
`Profile30.rates` (`Erdos993Lean/Analytic/Profile30.lean`) and `TailCert.aTab`
(`Erdos993Lean/Analytic/TailCert/Glue.lean`, Soul's `a` of `SOUL/O3/repaired_band_XX_t_Y.json`);
`Erdos993Lean/Analytic/TailCert/Main.lean` proves the copies equal (`edgesC_eq`, …).

* `checkIJ i j`: `checkBand λ_i λ_{i+1} a(i, j) ℓ(i, j) t_j` (band `i`, Laplace parameter `t_j`);
* `checkRow i`: `checkIJ i j` for `j = 0, …, 4`.

The only compiler hint is `@[noinline]` on `checkRow`, which keeps each check a single call into
the precompiled library when a downstream `native_decide` evaluates it.
-/

